                            <comment id="14733711" author="githubbot" created="Mon, 7 Sep 2015 13:30:01 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user tillrohrmann opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/288&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/288&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-287&quot; title=&quot;FlinkInterpreter does not properly captures standard output&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-287&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-287&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Adds proper standard output capturing to FlinkInterpreter&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    The `FlinkInterpreter` only captures output to `Console` and, thus, misses all output which goes to `System.out`. Some of Flink&apos;s functions, such as `DataSet&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;T&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;.print()`, print their results to `System.out`. Consequently Zeppelin&apos;s interpreter misses this output. This PR fixes this behaviour by redirecting `System.out` and by setting `System.out` as the `PrintStream` for `Console`.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;You can merge this pull request into a Git repository by running:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    $ git pull &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/tillrohrmann/incubator-zeppelin&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/tillrohrmann/incubator-zeppelin&lt;/a&gt; fixSysoutCapturing&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Alternatively you can review and apply these changes as the patch at:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/288.patch&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/288.patch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

